---
description: Unified AI development standard for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository root AGENTS.md.

Before inspecting source, read `.cursor/docs/INDEX.md`. It maps every doc and
every module. Read only the docs INDEX names as relevant to the current task.
Do not read the whole docs directory.

Record progress in `.cursor/docs/STATE.md` when a unit of work completes.
Record architecture choices in `.cursor/docs/DECISIONS.md`. Do not create docs
outside `.cursor/docs/` without approval.

Trust `.cursor/docs/MAP.md` over re-reading files. If MAP.md is wrong, fix
MAP.md in the same change.

`AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` in this repo are generated copies. Do
not edit them here. Edit the canonical folder, then run
`.\sync-standard.ps1 -All` from it.

When scaffolding a NEW repository, seed the standard by running the sync
script from the canonical folder with `-Target <new repo path>`. It copies
AGENTS.md, the rules, and the docs templates, and registers the repo. Do not
hand-copy these files -- the registry drifts and the repo silently stops
receiving updates.

Keep context usage minimal. Make surgical edits. Do not rewrite unrelated
files. Do not add dependencies without approval. Do not perform destructive
actions without explicit approval.
